          <div class="treatment-content">
            <img class="treatment-hero" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559839734-2b71ea197ec2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Dr. Sarah Mitchell, Interventional Cardiologist" />

            <span class="eyebrow">Cardiology</span>
            <h2>Dr. Sarah Mitchell</h2>
            <p class="text-primary" style="font-weight:600;font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">Interventional Cardiologist</p>

            <div class="treatment-body">
              <p>Dr. Sarah Mitchell specializes in complex coronary interventions and preventive cardiology. With over 15 years of experience, she leads MediCare Plus's Heart Wellness Program and has helped thousands of patients manage and recover from cardiovascular disease.</p>
              <p>She is known for combining advanced interventional techniques — including angioplasty and stent placement — with a strong focus on lifestyle-based prevention, helping patients avoid repeat hospitalizations and live healthier, longer lives.</p>

              <h3>Education &amp; Training</h3>
              <ul class="treatment-features">
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> MD, Harvard Medical School</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i> Fellowship in Interventional Cardiology, Cleveland Clinic</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate"></i> Board Certified, American Board of Internal Medicine (Cardiovascular Disease)</li>
              </ul>

              <h3>Areas of Expertise</h3>
              <ul class="treatment-features">
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i> Coronary angioplasty &amp; stenting</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i> Preventive &amp; lifestyle cardiology</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i> Cardiac catheterization</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i> Heart failure management</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
